        "collapsible_tab_bKn87j": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why are your perfumes so affordable?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>We focus on the fragrance itself.<strong>No</strong>luxury bottles,<strong>no</strong>besondere Packaging,<strong>no</strong>expensive shops &<strong>no</strong>costly influencer deals mean you can smell luxurious without breaking your budget.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_T6Fk9z": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this an Eau de Toilette?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>No, it is an Eau de Parfum – it contains between 19% and 21% fragrance oil, depending on the perfume. Eau de Toilette, for example, contains between 5% and 15%.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_GUrz86": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does the perfume last?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>How long the perfume lasts depends on the person and how it is applied. Sprayed on the skin, it lasts 8 to 12 hours or even longer thanks to our formula and 19–21% perfume oil concentration. The scent fades over time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_TKfWP3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does the inspired fragrance smell different?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>No, this fragrance is inspired by similar notes and belongs to the same fragrance family.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HiNKBa": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does 19% perfume mean?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>It means that the bottle contains between 19% and 21% perfume oil. Designer Eau de Toilette bottles contain between 10% and 15% perfume oil.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Qn8c4p": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can it be so much cheaper?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Fragrance compositions themselves are not protected by intellectual property rights and can therefore be legally reproduced and used as inspiration. This explains why many designer perfumes smell very similar and can sometimes be hard to tell apart.</p><p>Likewise, Magyx perfumes may be inspired by other fragrances and described as belonging to the same olfactory category as other perfumes.</p><p>Please note that all third-party fragrance names mentioned on our website belong exclusively to their respective rights holders and are used only to guide customers. They must under no circumstances be confused with products sold under those names.</p><p>Magyx Perfumes is not affiliated with the third-party brands mentioned and is not endorsed or recommended by them in any way.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
