            "text_2": "<p>Everything in the kit feels well made. Took a couple shaves to get used to it, but once I did, it’s been consistently good.</p>",
            "reviewer_3": "David M.",
            "text_3": "<p>I like that this brand focuses on the product instead of hype. Clean shave, easy routine, no pressure to</p>",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "text_size": 18,
